<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian treasury raises 85 mln dinars at auction.</title>
<headline>Tunisian treasury raises 85 mln dinars at auction.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian Treasury on Tuesday said it sold 85.05 million dinars of three-year notes at its weekly auction on December 3, repaying maturing paper totalling 85.5 million dinars.</p>
<p>The three-year notes payable in equal annual tranches were at an 8.0625 coupon rate, unchanged from their level last week.</p>
<p>Banks bid for 176.5 million dinars of three-, and four-year notes at between 8.0625 and 8.5 percent.  ($=0.98 dinar)</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
